# Chrome flags for offline / local-account bring-up on nvidia-generic.
#
# Applied by login_manager (board patch always ApplyUserConfig) and also merged
# into /etc/chrome_dev.conf by nvidia-generic-auth-chrome.conf on test images.
#
# Do NOT pass --load-extension here. Login/OOBE Chrome cannot host an MV3
# extension; it crashes and ChromeOS powerwashes.
#
# Do NOT use the on-screen "Create local account" → Next button. That is
# Chrome's Gaia-fallback UI and crashes without Google API keys.
# Create users on VT2 or http://127.0.0.1:17891/ (local-password factor).
# Do not enable --allow-os-install (Flex auto-picks a disk and can erase Ubuntu).

--oobe-skip-to-login
--allow-failed-policy-fetch-for-test
--disable-gaia-services
# Offline password pod for localuser@localhost (AuthFactor label local-password).
# Without this, UNKNOWN OAuthTokenStatus forces Google verification UI.
--skip-force-online-signin-for-testing
